Aren't all twisted-pair links FD capable? 

Don't have specs for the DE450 at hand... but
<http://www.aei-
it.com/support/download/pfec_download/Windows/WinNT4sp4/OEMSETUP.INF>
offers a "10BaseT Full_Duplex" connection setting.

